      <thead>
        <tr><th>Relation</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How Hyperactivity Represents It</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Digest equality</strong></td><td>Identical serialized file or string representation.</td><td>Cryptographic content hash (<code>store/&lt;sha256&gt;/</code>).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Definitional equality</strong></td><td>Isomorphic molecular graphs (same connectivity &amp; stereochemistry).</td><td>Structured graphs preserving exact <strong>automorphism groups</strong> (computing symmetry numbers &amp; NMR orbit peak counts directly) and orientation-preserving chirality.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Semantic equality</strong></td><td>Same chemical substance across mobile protons (tautomers).</td><td>A <strong>Higher Inductive Type (HIT)</strong> whose paths are explicit proton-transfer steps — so two tautomers are distinct points connected by an explicit, transportable path.</td></tr>
